## Derived / not-overridable — NOT operator knobs (removed from list above)

These aren't things an operator sets — the process computes them. Listed only to record the decision.

| Var | Derived from | Resolves to | Note |
|---|---|---|---|
| `SLAYZONE_HUB_AUTH_REQUIRED` | **exposure axis** (`SLAYZONE_HOST` non-loopback) | loopback → off; exposed → on | Do NOT derive from SUPERVISED (breaks loopback fork). Drop the flag; auto-on when exposed. Tradeoff: loses exposed-but-trusted-VPN-off + loopback-behind-proxy-on edge cases |
| `SLAYZONE_DB_PATH` | `SLAYZONE_ROOT` | `<ROOT>/slayzone.sqlite` | Code STAYS: supervised REQUIRES it (host passes exact path; `db.ts:32` throws if unset). Not a standalone knob |
| `SLAYZONE_STORE_DIR` | `SLAYZONE_ROOT` | `<ROOT>` | Code STAYS: desktop app + supervised read it (`getTrpcDataRoot`, `ensureDataRoot`). Not a standalone knob |

